        <mxCell id="source-scope-note" value="PARTIAL_SCOPE_OR_ACCEPTANCE. SRS widgets beyond the listed current metrics remain partial; no revenue/order/complaint-age value is fabricated. A read-only snapshot transaction has no command identity, audit event or money effect. Read source/port lifeline groups the named query dependencies; it is not an invented runtime repository class. A read-only snapshot transaction, when used in source, does not imply a domain mutation, replay result store, ledger entry or money transfer. Sources: backend/src/routes/dashboard-runtime.routes.js; backend/src/controllers/dashboard-read.controller.js; backend/src/services/dashboards/read-projection.js; backend/src/services/dashboards/mongo-operational-dashboard.repository.js; backend/src/services/dashboards/admin-dashboard.service.js." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
